  "description": "Building upon the legacy of its predecessors, the faster-than-ever Roadmachine 01 combines speed, comfort, and versatility, redefining the ultimate endurance rocket.\nCrafted from our premium 01-grade carbon, it takes integration to the next level with sleek cable routing, down tube storage, and a seamlessly integrated rear light for maximum safety on long rides.\nEngineered to accommodate larger tires and designed for maximum compliance, it smooths out rough roads while conserving your energy. Comfort has never been this fast.\nEquipped with a full SRAM Red groupset, including a power meter, the exceptional DT Swiss ERC wheelset, and our own ICS Carbon Evo one-piece cockpit for unrivaled control, the Roadmachine 01 stands as the flagship of the range – the pinnacle of endurance bikes.",
